        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 24 at 5:41PM MDT until September 24 at 5:45PM MDT by NWS El Paso Tx/Santa Teresa NM</headline>
        <description>The heavy rain has ended. Flood waters have receded although minor
flooding maybe ongoing. Please continue to heed remaining road
closures.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 600 AM MDT Friday for a portion
of south central New Mexico.
</description>
